{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buddies in a Ball is a hilarious co-op platformer where you and up to 4 friends are stuck inside of a metal ball together. Coordinate your movements, roll, jump, and scream your way through diverse levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/fdd2b81e44d151d848c0e595710fbf78.poster.avif?t=1759415217\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/fdd2b81e44d151d848c0e595710fbf78.webm?t=1759415217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/fdd2b81e44d151d848c0e595710fbf78.mp4?t=1759415217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay Elements:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork Matters:</strong>\u00a01-4 players control the ball together\u2014communication and coordination are key! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Driven Fun:</strong> Realistic rolling physics, speed, and momentum make every level a new challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Show:</strong> The announcer keeps the action exciting, commenting on your triumphs and failures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Levels:</strong> Navigate ramps, jumps, obstacles, and rotating platforms in diverse arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong>\u00a0Compete to finish each level in the fastest time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Characters:</strong> Pick your favorite goofy character.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/3c6998e04632cb1b0b3c26375d546ef4.poster.avif?t=1759415217\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/3c6998e04632cb1b0b3c26375d546ef4.webm?t=1759415217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/3c6998e04632cb1b0b3c26375d546ef4.mp4?t=1759415217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy: Access every level, unlimited respawns, no time limits, and explore the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Default: Respawn at the beginning of the current level when you fall. Complete each level to unlock the next.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard: 3 lives per act, if you run out of lives, start from the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mentally ill: One life, one game, if you fall, restart from level one. You probably have or need a therapist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Mode: Jump in the ball alone and take on the course by yourself, weirdo.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play Buddies in a Ball?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love physics-based challenges, funny co-op gameplay, and the thrill of surviving impossible levels, this game is for you. Whether you're strategizing with your teammates or screaming at them for rolling the wrong way, each round promises laughs and adrenaline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/56b15d19cd71b4f41c70c27dda635444.poster.avif?t=1759415217\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c